IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-DPO-OBJECTIVE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 CHOSEN-DIFF         PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 REJECTED-DIFF       PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 BETA-X100           PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 MARGIN-X100         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-DPO.
    IF BETA-X100 == 0
        MOVE 10 TO BETA-X100.
    END-IF.

    MOVE CHOSEN-DIFF TO MARGIN-X100.
    SUBTRACT REJECTED-DIFF FROM MARGIN-X100.
    MULTIPLY BETA-X100 BY MARGIN-X100.
    DIVIDE 100 INTO MARGIN-X100.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 MARGIN-X100.
    WEIGHT 30 BETA-X100.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
